{"created": "2026-11-11T21:12:59.417991+00:00", "modified": "2026-11-11T21:12:59.613505+00:00", "id": 24146384, "conceptrecid": "24146383", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146384", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146383", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24146384", "metadata": {"title": "cfrp-strengthening", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.24146384", "publication_date": "2026-11-11", "description": "<p>This repository turns the ACI 440.2R design checks for externally bonded FRP strengthening into small public calculations that anyone can re-run from the inputs alone.</p><p>Status: active. One recorded result, labelled VERIFIED for ten printed quantities, is that the checker reproduces the Simpson Strong-Tie worked example. The strengthened design strength, 481.7 kip-ft against a demand of 457.8 kip-ft, is checker output, and the result does not claim serviceability.</p><p>Code in this repository is under the MIT Licence. Text, notes, and site content in this repository are under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence (CC BY 4.0).</p><p>ACI 440.2R-17, ACI 318-14, and ACI 562-16 are copyrighted by ACI. The Simpson Strong-Tie worked example is copyrighted by Simpson Strong-Tie. We do not copy their text, tables, figures, or layout into this archive. Cited, not copied.</p><p>Directed by Shahid Arifuddin</p><p>Researched and verified by different model families across Gemini, Claude, Grok, OpenAI, and Muse</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Arifuddin, Shahid", "affiliation": null}], "keywords": ["aci-440", "carbon-fiber", "cfrp", "cfrp-strengthening", "civil-engineering", "concrete", "foundation-0", "structural-engineering"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/cfrp-strengthening", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v1.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Foundation-0/cfrp-strengthening"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software",